  },
  "subQuests": [
    {
      "subId": "7106101",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Xamaran",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710610101"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710610101": {
            "id": "710610101",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "How curious! This two-legged hatchling makes no use of her feet.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610102"
            ]
          },
          "710610102": {
            "id": "710610102",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "\"Two-legged hatchling\"? Hmph, Paimon's got a name! And looks like someone's gonna get themselves the silliest nickname in the world ever!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610103"
            ]
          },
          "710610103": {
            "id": "710610103",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Let Paimon think... You know what, we're gonna call you \"Sheeshroom\"!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610104"
            ]
          },
          "710610104": {
            "id": "710610104",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Also, look at this glowing powder in the air. Are they mushroom spores? Paimon wonders if they're the reason why we could hear this mushroom talking.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610105"
            ]
          },
          "710610105": {
            "id": "710610105",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "Xamaran knows many legged ones who make no use of their feet. Yet Xamaran knows not any Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610106"
            ]
          },
          "710610106": {
            "id": "710610106",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hehe, that's natural, because Paimon is one of a kind.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610107"
            ]
          },
          "710610107": {
            "id": "710610107",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "Xamaran knows the two-legged one over there. How strangely familiar.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610108"
            ]
          },
          "710610108": {
            "id": "710610108",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME}, do you know Sheeshroom?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610111"
            ]
          },
          "710610111": {
            "id": "710610111",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "Xamaran smells the heat of golden sand and the dampness from deep within the rainforest. That's the smell of Xamaran's hometown.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610112"
            ]
          },
          "710610112": {
            "id": "710610112",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hot sand and the rainforest? Do you mean Sumeru? We did just talk to a Sumeru scholar at the camp...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610113"
            ]
          },
          "710610113": {
            "id": "710610113",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "Although Xamaran has been away from its hometown for long, Xamaran makes no mistakes.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610114"
            ]
          },
          "710610114": {
            "id": "710610114",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "#{NICKNAME} the Two-Legged, fate has brought you here. Xamaran has a favor to ask.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610115"
            ]
          },
          "710610115": {
            "id": "710610115",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "Xamaran has dwelled here for many a year and found it a cozy and comfy home...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610116"
            ]
          },
          "710610116": {
            "id": "710610116",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "Yet foul energy is growing lately. Xamaran has been drained of strength fending off the evil and has ended up in this state. Xamaran must seek help from the two-legged.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610117"
            ]
          },
          "710610117": {
            "id": "710610117",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Sheeshroom does look a little under the weather...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610118"
            ]
          },
          "710610118": {
            "id": "710610118",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Hm... Oh right, {NICKNAME}, we can lend the energy of the Adjuvant to Sheeshroom, perhaps? Maybe that'll make it feel better."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7106102",
      "subQuestName": "Give Xamaran some of the Adjuvant's power",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "710610201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "710610201": {
            "id": "710610201",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You lend the energy of the Adjuvant to Xamaran.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610202"
            ]
          },
          "710610202": {
            "id": "710610202",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! Sheeshroom is glowing. Should Paimon call it a \"Shiningroom\" now?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610203"
            ]
          },
          "710610203": {
            "id": "710610203",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "#Hail {NICKNAME}! Hail Paimon!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610204"
            ]
          },
          "710610204": {
            "id": "710610204",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "#Thanks to {NICKNAME}, and thanks to Paimon also! Xamaran life-light is rekindled!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610205"
            ]
          },
          "710610205": {
            "id": "710610205",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Xamaran",
            "text": "But do not let your guard down yet. Xamaran knows that the foul energy is not yet eradicated. It could strike back at any time.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610206"
            ]
          },
          "710610206": {
            "id": "710610206",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh? Then what do we do!?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "710610207"
            ]
          },
          "710610207": {
            "id": "710610207",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Whoa! Where did all this black mud come from? Is it the \"foul energy\" that Sheeshroom talked about?"
          }
        }
      }
    },
